@startuml
title 用户修改个人信息通讯图

' 设置样式：使用直角线，白色背景
skinparam linestyle ortho
skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}

' 1. 定义参与交互的对象
object ":User" as User
object ":ProfileUI" as UI
object ":ProfileController" as Ctrl
object ":UserStatusChecker" as Auth
object ":ContentReviewSystem" as Review
object ":FileStorage" as File
object ":UserDB" as DB

' 2. 布局辅助 (使用 hidden 线条调整位置)
' 让 Auth 在 Ctrl 上方
Auth -[hidden]down- Ctrl
' 让 Review 和 File 都在 Ctrl 右侧，且 Review 在 File 上方
Review -[hidden]down- File

' 3. 定义链接 (Links) 与 消息 (Messages)

' [左侧] User <-> UI
User -right- UI : 1: selectModifyItem(item) > \n 2: inputNewInfo(newValue) > \n 13: showModifyResult(result, status) <

' [左中] UI -> Controller
UI -right- Ctrl : 3: submitModify(item, newValue) >

' [上方] Controller <-> Auth (身份验证)
Ctrl -up- Auth : 4: checkLoginStatus(userId) > \n 5: returnLoginStatus(status) <

' [中心] Controller 自调用 (本地格式校验 & 提交审核逻辑)
Ctrl -left- Ctrl : 6: validateInfoFormat(item, newValue) \n 12: submitToAdminReview(userId, item, newValue)

' [右上方] Controller <-> Review (内容审核)
Ctrl -right- Review : 7: reviewSensitiveInfo(newValue) > \n 8: returnReviewResult(result) <

' [右下方] Controller -> FileStorage (头像文件存储)
' 注意：这里通常由控制器发起上传
Ctrl -right- File : 9: saveAvatarFile(file) >

' [下方] Controller <-> DB (数据更新)
Ctrl -down- DB : 10: updateUserInfo(userId, item, newValue) > \n 11: returnModifyResult(result) <

@enduml